# A SOLICIT as systemd-networkd sends it, reconstructed by hand: a DUID-EN client identifier
# with systemd's enterprise number 43793 and an 8-octet identifier, an IA_NA with an IAID,
# Rapid Commit, an option request for 23, 24, 56, 31 and 82, elapsed time, and a Client FQDN
# (RFC 4704) with the S flag and the partial name "laptop" without a root label.
#
# msg-type SOLICIT, transaction id 0x0b17c9
01 0b 17 c9
# option 1, client identifier, 14 octets: DUID-EN (type 2), enterprise 43793, 8 octets
00 01 00 0e
00 02 00 00 ab 11
a1 b2 c3 d4 e5 f6 07 18
# option 3, IA_NA, 12 octets: IAID 2, T1 0, T2 0
00 03 00 0c
00 00 00 02
00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
# option 14, rapid commit, empty
00 0e 00 00
# option 6, option request, 10 octets: 23, 24, 56, 31, 82
00 06 00 0a
00 17 00 18 00 38 00 1f 00 52
# option 8, elapsed time 0
00 08 00 02 00 00
# option 39, client FQDN, 8 octets: flags S (0x01), the name "laptop" (partial)
00 27 00 08
01
06 6c 61 70 74 6f 70
